98358267973", "personaname": "燃情I灰烬", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198358267973/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 22385, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 502, "playtime_at_review": 10328, "last_played": 1787974704, "avatar": "670e1c4e55850888acf87a877397b1b8e50d0c04"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "妈嘞个比的服务器啊", "timestamp_created": 1723157015, "timestamp_updated": 1724045365, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "171710047", "author": {"steamid": "76561199227738570", "personaname": "暗黑若叶睦", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199227738570/", "num_games_owned": 84, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 32620, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 762, "playtime_at_review": 23324, "last_played": 1787961805, "avatar": "b7066fb6ff81e0241bea7620e0bda9e06b669c13"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "虫子的蟑龙，机器人的干扰塔，光能的利维坦是箭头的三大野爹是吧，说啥都不改，能对他们造成威胁的东西全给你砍了，我操你妈狗东西，一个PVE爽游非要出各种粪怪和机制恶心玩家，得了一个最佳运营给你逼脸给多了是吧", "timestamp_created": 1723154045, "timestamp_updated": 1757625847, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "171708079", "author": {"steamid": "76561198082928029", "personaname": "海克斯科技", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198082928029/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 73, "playtime_forever": 28149, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 22871, "last_played": 1775405512, "avatar": "969452dc8c2635a8e9cd6f2fa69cb464feafa526"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "无视全球玩家社区的努力，一脑子只有你守斯德哥尔摩的剧本，去你ma的，箭头你自己去守吧！\n————————————————————————————————\n好呀好呀，锁进度，不能完全解放是吧，那其他大城市怎么就完全沦陷了？上海守下来我想去纽约打游击！", "timestamp_created": 1723151776, "timestamp_updated": 1748526588, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "171706463", "author": {"steamid": "76561198850571194", "personaname": "Sanitäter", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198850571194/", "num_games_owned": 60, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 18394, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1889, "playtime_at_review": 4119, "last_played": 1788032984, "avatar": "14dcb8f23c0d4b9e62e16d308378811ad6af366b"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "从下载玩到现在的60+小时，感觉越打到后面这游戏越不是给人玩的，策划只会给游戏加难度，却不考虑玩家的体验，8月6日的更新虫子和机器人都有加强，反而是玩家操控的绝地潜兵什么新战备都没有，所谓的“自由升级”指的是给敌人的单方面升级，真的想不明白到底我们是你的玩家，还是那些赛博虫子机器人是你的玩家，游戏平衡也是一坨，只会无脑砍好用的武器，还说什么“有的武器强度太高导致其他武器黯然失色才要砍的”，有没有可能是你其他武器本来设计的就是垃圾根本不好用我们玩家才来来回回只用那几把武器，亏你游戏背景下说超级地球有多强能和虫子机器人双线作战，结果给潜兵的枪械是刮痧的，炸弹是掺沙的，，高难度下虫子0帧拉警报马上召唤牛牛和新出的穿刺虫，游戏给的战备根本无法快速解决，玩家只能被撵着跑，然后虫子没死又继续拉警报无限循环，我来玩你这PVE游戏是想来体验打虫子的快感，不是来体验比PVP游戏更坐牢的体验，与其买2代玩真不如1代+DLC用雷鸣炸的爽快", "timestamp_created": 1723149911, "timestamp_updated": 1723149911, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.553004920482635498", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}]}